#: ContextView/ContextView.gpr.py:29 ContextView/ContextView.py:508
msgid "Context"
msgstr ""

#: ContextView/ContextView.gpr.py:31
msgid ""
"A chart placing a person in the context of their immediate family: the "
"couple in the centre, each partner's parents above them, their children "
"below, and each partner's siblings in a column to their own side, eldest at "
"the top. Click any box to re-centre the chart on that person; the name in "
"bold marks the way back to the home person."
msgstr ""

